Just init.lua, lazy-lock.json, matugen_colors.lua -- not the full Neovim
config directory. Plugins are managed live by lazy.nvim (git-bootstrapped
from init.lua) into ~/.local/share/nvim, ~404M and reproducible from
lazy-lock.json, so not backed up here. See modules/editors.nix in the main
repo for why Nix only provides the nvim binary itself.
